    "turn_text": "I understand and risk protection is obviously there. Hey, and I've been a farmer too and the target price and the loan rates and things that we used to have before, those are great if you have a crop. But what if you don't have a crop? How does this program need to be beyond just the target price structure that you and some others are looking for?",
