    "turn_text": "Well, I think the key is, and you sum it up very well, and you understand that, is being a farmer and thinks that one size doesn't fit all. And that's really what we're trying to do is come up with a system that has the flexibility for farmers where they have different needs. And some people are more worried about yield, others are more worried about price. And so within the farm bill, there has to be the flexibility to meet both of those needs.",
