    "turn_text": "Well, I think that you're exactly right in the sense that there's lots of discussion along those lines. But I don't know that we're there yet. Now, as I speak, you know, as we're speaking, literally, you know, our staffs are working really very, very hard to try and kind of compromise out. And most importantly, make it such that we come up with a program that's not a one size fits all because it just doesn't work.",
