    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72845.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "I'm going to throw my advocate head on here, so forgive me for just a moment. Unlike those programs before where the mailbox was a big percentage of farmer revenue, I see this program as one where, yes, taxpayer dollars are in the game, but so are farmer dollars and so are crop insurance companies. It's a triad of risk protection because ultimately, I say we all have skinned again.",
